              </h3>
              <div class="zm-points">
                <div class="zm-point">
                  <strong data-en="Research question" data-zh="研究问题">Research question</strong>
                  <p
                    data-en="How can a robot move safely around an interventional imaging system without blocking the anatomy clinicians need to see?"
